.TH "libnvme" 9 "struct nvme_zns_desc" "October 2026" "API Manual" LINUX
.SH NAME
struct nvme_zns_desc \- Zone Descriptor Data Structure
.SH SYNOPSIS
struct nvme_zns_desc {
.br
.BI "    __u8 zt;"
.br
.BI "    __u8 zs;"
.br
.BI "    __u8 za;"
.br
.BI "    __u8 zai;"
.br
.BI "    __u8 rsvd4[4];"
.br
.BI "    __le64 zcap;"
.br
.BI "    __le64 zslba;"
.br
.BI "    __le64 wp;"
.br
.BI "    __u8 rsvd32[32];"
.br
.BI "
};
.br

.SH Members
.IP "zt" 12
Zone Type Attributes, ZT is bits 3:0, see \fIenum nvme_zns_zt\fP
.IP "zs" 12
Zone State Attributes, ZS is bits 7:4, see \fIenum nvme_zns_zs\fP
.IP "za" 12
Zone Attributes, see \fIenum nvme_zns_za\fP
.IP "zai" 12
Zone Attributes Information, see \fIenum nvme_zns_zai\fP
.IP "rsvd4" 12
Reserved
.IP "zcap" 12
Zone Capacity
.IP "zslba" 12
Zone Start Logical Block Address
.IP "wp" 12
Write Pointer
.IP "rsvd32" 12
Reserved
